## Items belonging to a Warlock's pact with their patron.

object-warlock_talisman = Warlock's Talisman
    .desc =
        A patron-touched charm, cold to the touch and never quite still.
        A Warlock may bind it to whoever carries it: the bearer is warded
        against harm, strikes back at whoever wounds them, and may call
        themselves back to their Warlock's side.
